<title>LATVIA: Short-term Latvian T-bill yields rise at auction.</title>
<headline>Short-term Latvian T-bill yields rise at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian Treasury bills were mixed at auction on Wednesday with the yields on short-term paper rising but falling on longer-maturity paper, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	10.0	    9.78	 1.0    1.29   1.0</p>
<p> 91-day	10.83	  10.10	 1.40   0.76   0.76</p>
<p> Six-month   11.96	  12.01	 2.75   4.23   2.75</p>
<p> One-year    12.88	  12.90	 1.35   3.12   1.35</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
